Since then, Amazon has started a program in which private persons and companies can offer used books for sale mediated by Amazon. These sellers are, as you have seen, charging exorbitant prices. Perhaps in the assumption that it&#39;s out of print. Which it&#39;s not; the LLG still has plenty of copies left.<br>

